id: platformer
name: Fighting, shooting and action games
games: Fortnite, PUBG Mobile, Call of Duty Mobile, Free Fire, Brawl Stars, Mobile Legends, Genshin Impact, Minecraft, Roblox, Among Us, Stumble Guys
---
These games are real-time and each decision takes a few seconds, so play it safe: in menus, start a practice or training mode, a bot match, a creative world or a tutorial, never ranked or paid modes. In play, use the left thumb on the movement stick (swipe from the stick centre toward where to go, 600 to 1500 ms) and tap the right-side buttons (fire, jump, interact) at the same time. Move toward objectives or loot, avoid open ground, and heal when low. You are much slower than a person, so say so if the user expects fast aim.
Fast policy idea: to spam the fire button while a red enemy is visible: {"policy":{"ms":6000,"hz":4,"rules":[{"when":{"blob":{"color":"red","pick":"nearest_center"}},"do":[{"hold":[0.85,0.75],"ms":300}],"cool":250}]}}.
